  "question": {
    "text": "Two cars are approaching each other at an equal speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>hr</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;When they see each other, both blow horns having a frequency of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>676</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The beat frequency heard by each driver will be _______<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Hz</mi><mo>.</mo></math> [Velocity of sound in air is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>340</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/28651a6a-0d04-41b9-9a94-36df70d0890d-image.png\" style=\"width: 362px; height: 96px;\" /></p><p>Frequency of sound heard by car-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> which comes by reflection from car-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>342</mn><mn>338</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Frequency of sound coming directly from car-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mn>342</mn><mn>338</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>342</mn><mn>338</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>09</mn><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p>",
